# A powerline-style prompt: coloured segments where the colour lives in blank
# cells. Erasing to end of line must keep the background it was erased with.
size: 16x2
description: prompt segments keep the background carried by blank cells

--- input
\e[48;5;236m\e[38;5;252m user \e[0m\e[48;5;240m git \e[0m

--- expect-cell
row=0 col=1 has_background=true has_foreground=true
row=0 col=7 has_background=true
